OL,3,GNEWSARower's world record attempt ends
OL,4,Ain heartbreak
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman's bid to set a world record by
OL,7,Fbeing part of a mixed team rowing 5,500
OL,8,Fmiles (8,851km) across the Indian Ocean
OL,9,Fhas ended in heartbreak.
OL,11,FLara Vafiadis and her three crew
OL,12,Fmembers were forced to abandon their
OL,13,Fchallenge just 1,000 miles(1609km) from
OL,14,Fthe finish line in Kenya, after setting
OL,15,Foff from Australia in July.
OL,17,FThe 36-year-old would have also become
OL,18,Fthe first woman to make the venture but
OL,19,Fa broken rudder left the crew stranded
OL,20,Fand at risk of capsizing.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
