OL,3,GNEWSARower's world record attempt ends
OL,4,Ain heartbreak
OL,5,
OL,6,F"When I heard that rudder break... the
OL,7,Fwhole team was just heartbroken and I
OL,8,Fthink it will take a long time for us
OL,9,Fto get over it," Vafiadis said.
